{"id":"becb68cbe0f3a15e","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-differential-between-manifolds.md","title":"Differential Between Manifolds","display":"df-differential-between-manifolds — Differential Between Manifolds","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-differential-between-manifolds","aliases":["58-df-differential-between-manifolds"],"display":"df-differential-between-manifolds — Differential Between Manifolds","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-tangent-space.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-tangent.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-differential-between-manifolds"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-differential-between-manifolds</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-differential-between-manifolds — Differential Between Manifolds"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d87c5d842ade903d\" href=\"?note=d87c5d842ade903d\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md\">../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cd9981d8428c2629\" href=\"?note=cd9981d8428c2629\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-tangent-space.md\">../batch18/58-df-tangent-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4aec613831b7dd67\" href=\"?note=4aec613831b7dd67\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-tangent.md\">../batch19/58-df-tangent.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L,f,p,M,N\\in V\">\\(L,f,p,M,N\\in V\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SmoothMapStructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SmoothMapStructure}_S\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^\\infty\">\\(C^\\infty\\)</span> 使用内部光滑映射文件；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TangentSpaceStructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TangentSpaceStructure}_S\\)</span> 使用内部切空间定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DifferentialBetween}_S(L,f,p,M,N)\">\\(\\mathrm{DifferentialBetween}_S(L,f,p,M,N)\\)</span> 保留五参数接口；各次调用中的两组光滑结构在同一个存在量词辖域内固定。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> 是内部集合函数谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}differential\\text{-}between\\text{-}manifolds}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{DifferentialBetween}_S(L,f,p,M,N)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists n,m\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\tau_M,\\tau_N,\\mathcal A_M,\\mathcal A_N,T_M,T_N\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{SmoothMapStructure}_S(f,M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M,n,N,\\tau_N,\\mathcal A_N,m)\\land p\\in M\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{TangentSpaceStructure}_S(T_M,M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M,p,n)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{TangentSpaceStructure}_S(T_N,N,\\tau_N,\\mathcal A_N,f(p),m)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(L,T_M,T_N)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall v\\in T_M\\;\\forall h\\in C^\\infty(N,\\tau_N,\\mathcal A_N;\\mathbb R)\\;\nL(v)(h)=v(h\\circ f)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}differential\\text{-}between\\text{-}manifolds}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{DifferentialBetween}_S(L,f,p,M,N)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists n,m\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\tau_M,\\tau_N,\\mathcal A_M,\\mathcal A_N,T_M,T_N\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{SmoothMapStructure}_S(f,M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M,n,N,\\tau_N,\\mathcal A_N,m)\\land p\\in M\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{TangentSpaceStructure}_S(T_M,M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M,p,n)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{TangentSpaceStructure}_S(T_N,N,\\tau_N,\\mathcal A_N,f(p),m)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(L,T_M,T_N)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall v\\in T_M\\;\\forall h\\in C^\\infty(N,\\tau_N,\\mathcal A_N;\\mathbb R)\\;\nL(v)(h)=v(h\\circ f)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>保留导子推前的数学对象和原五元接口；映射、两个切空间、测试函数使用同一组存在绑定的结构。</li>\n<li>不再用“在任意可能结构下光滑”的三元谓词选择测试函数，以免 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(v)\">\\(L(v)\\)</span> 的输入落在其定义域之外。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"d87c5d842ade903d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-tangent-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"cd9981d8428c2629","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-tangent-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-tangent.md","status":"resolved","id":"4aec613831b7dd67","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-tangent.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L,f,p,M,N\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SmoothMapStructure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"C^\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TangentSpaceStructure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DifferentialBetween}_S(L,f,p,M,N)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}differential\\text{-}between\\text{-}manifolds}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{DifferentialBetween}_S(L,f,p,M,N)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\exists n,m\\in\\omega_{>0}\\;\\exists\\tau_M,\\tau_N,\\mathcal A_M,\\mathcal A_N,T_M,T_N\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&\\mathrm{SmoothMapStructure}_S(f,M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M,n,N,\\tau_N,\\mathcal A_N,m)\\land p\\in M\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{TangentSpaceStructure}_S(T_M,M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M,p,n)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{TangentSpaceStructure}_S(T_N,N,\\tau_N,\\mathcal A_N,f(p),m)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Function}(L,T_M,T_N)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall v\\in T_M\\;\\forall h\\in C^\\infty(N,\\tau_N,\\mathcal A_N;\\mathbb R)\\;\nL(v)(h)=v(h\\circ f)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"L(v)","display":false}],"bytes":1820,"backlinks":[{"id":"4e5a25c93496ad88","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DifferentialBetween}_S\\subseteq V^5$ (see [[./58-df-differential-between-manifolds.md]])."},{"id":"f10cb4e88874efad","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DifferentialBetween}_S\\subseteq V^5$ and $\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[./58-df-differential-between-manifolds.md]], [[../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md]])."},{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-377","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-differential-between-manifolds]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-424","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-differential-between-manifolds.md|58-df-differential-between-manifolds]]（batch14）"}],"outgoing":["d87c5d842ade903d","cd9981d8428c2629","36d7463d215be751","4aec613831b7dd67"]}